{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35458","headline":"病马五首呈郑校书章三吴十五先辈 五 · 曹唐","name":"病马五首呈郑校书章三吴十五先辈 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病久无人着意看，玉华衫色欲凋残。\n饮惊白露泉花冷，吃怕清秋荳叶寒。\n长襜敢辞红锦重，旧缰宁畏紫丝蟠。\n王良若许相擡策，千里追风也不难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}